The '''Pirate Village''' is an island west of [[Middle Town]] that hosts quests for players [[Levels]] 30 to 60.

==Appearance==
The Pirate Village is divided into two main sections: the village and the surrounding wilderness. The village area is paved with cobblestone and features several multicolored houses, including a purple-roofed mansion with a flag. The wilderness area is characterized by jagged rocks, grassy terrain, and sparsely placed [[trees]].

